.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Test suite for the doubly-linked list (t_dlist) implementation\&. 


.PP
\fBAuthor\fP
.RS 4
pulgamecanica (arosado-)
.RE
.PP
Covers ft_dlstnew(), ft_dlstadd_back(), ft_dlstsize()\&.

.PP
Forward and backward traversal via \fR->next\fP / \fR->prev\fP, and ft_dlstclear()\&.

.PP
This suite is always compiled and always runs — it is not guarded by a feature flag because \fRt_list\fP is a core Libft primitive\&. 
.SH "Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "void test_dlist_suite (void )"
Run all doubly-linked list assertions\&.

.PP
Builds a three-node list \fR[1 <-> 2 <-> 3]\fP, verifies size, forward and backward links, sentinel NULL values at both ends, then calls ft_dlstclear() and asserts the head pointer is NULL afterwards\&. 
